invariant: INV-61
file: profile_cfg.h
catches: cnsa2_test_mldsa
reason: a raw-mldsa build keeps the 512-byte raw floor, so CH_MIN_RXBUF is
  the ML-KEM-1024 ServerHello's 1637 bytes and a buffer at the floor
  cannot hold an ML-DSA-87 certificate. test_mldsa_floor's handshake at
  CH_X509_MAX fails with CH_ECAP.

--- old
#define CH_RAW_TRUST_MIN_RXBUF ((CH_X509_MAX + 5) + 8 + 22)
--- new
#define CH_RAW_TRUST_MIN_RXBUF 512
